sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Manual / Auto browse
    participant P as Player
    participant W as Browser Worker
    participant M as Media API
    participant D as WASM
    participant C as Canvas
    A->>P: load + play
    P->>W: start attempt
    alt Streaming supported and within budget
    W->>M: authenticated stream
    loop incoming data
        M-->>W: bytes
        W->>D: append
        opt Input capacity grows
            D->>D: release borrowed demux / iterator before realloc
        end
        D-->>W: complete frame / need data
        W-->>P: pixels + duration
        P->>C: draw
    end
    A->>P: pause
    P->>P: freeze remaining duration
    P->>W: backpressure
    A->>P: play
    P->>W: resume
    M-->>W: EOF
    W->>D: validate complete input
    W-->>P: input complete
    opt Manual playback with remaining file loops
        W->>D: repeat (reuse validated input)
        D->>D: reset compositor, no download
        W-->>P: next cycle frames with backpressure
    end
    P->>P: finish final frame duration
    P-->>A: ended once
    alt Auto browse
        A->>A: next image / scroll
    else Manual finite loops ended
        A->>A: keep final canvas, no navigation
    end
    else Pre-frame compatibility fallback
        P-->>A: reason category, four-second notice
    end
